{"id":"f5ad19f3a79bf5de","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds.md","title":"正则语言判空、判无限与等价性的有限见证","display":"thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds — 正则语言判空、判无限与等价性的有限见证","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds","aliases":["73-thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds"],"display":"thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds — 正则语言判空、判无限与等价性的有限见证","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]","[[73-df-dfa-product]]","[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§4.3–4.4, print pp. 150–165; PDF pp. 172–187; local bounded-witness corollary","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorems 3.7–3.8, pp. 63–65; scans 71–73","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":4},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds — 正则语言判空、判无限与等价性的有限见证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" href=\"?note=e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" title=\"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping\">73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1b2071b23104400\" href=\"?note=e1b2071b23104400\" title=\"73-df-dfa-product\">73-df-dfa-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"33c001ba790a35c7\" href=\"?note=33c001ba790a35c7\" title=\"73-thm-dfa-product-correctness\">73-thm-dfa-product-correctness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§4.3–4.4, print pp. 150–165; PDF pp. 172–187; local bounded-witness corollary"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorems 3.7–3.8, pp. 63–65; scans 71–73"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)\">\\(N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)\\)</span> 为同一字母表上的 DFA；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|Q|,m=|P|\">\\(n=|Q|,m=|P|\\)</span>。语言语义、泵引理和乘积见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" href=\"?note=e48ecbf40a3c92b6\" title=\"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping\">73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e1b2071b23104400\" href=\"?note=e1b2071b23104400\" title=\"73-df-dfa-product\">73-df-dfa-product</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"33c001ba790a35c7\" href=\"?note=33c001ba790a35c7\" title=\"73-thm-dfa-product-correctness\">73-thm-dfa-product-correctness</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\nL(M)\\ne\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in L(M)\\;|w|&lt;n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\nL(M)\\ne\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in L(M)\\;|w|&lt;n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\n|L(M)|\\ge\\aleph_0\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in L(M)\\;(n\\le|w|&lt;2n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\n|L(M)|\\ge\\aleph_0\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in L(M)\\;(n\\le|w|&lt;2n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\nL(M)\\ne L(N)\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[|w|&lt;nm\\land\\bigl((w\\in L(M)\\land w\\notin L(N))\\lor(w\\notin L(M)\\land w\\in L(N))\\bigr)\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\nL(M)\\ne L(N)\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[|w|&lt;nm\\land\\bigl((w\\in L(M)\\land w\\notin L(N))\\lor(w\\notin L(M)\\land w\\in L(N))\\bigr)\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最短接受路径无重复状态，故判空见证长度小于 n。无限语言中取长度至少 n 的最短词；若长度至少 2n，可用泵段删除得到仍至少 n 的更短词，矛盾；反向由非空泵段产生无限多个词。等价性对有 nm 个状态的对称差乘积应用判空界。这些公式给出明确有限搜索，并非把“可判定”当作未解释谓词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping","status":"resolved","id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-product","status":"resolved","id":"e1b2071b23104400","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-dfa-product-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"33c001ba790a35c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 为同一字母表上的 DFA；令 $n=|Q|,m=|P|$。语言语义、泵引理和乘积见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]、[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]、[[73-df-dfa-product]]、[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping","status":"resolved","id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 为同一字母表上的 DFA；令 $n=|Q|,m=|P|$。语言语义、泵引理和乘积见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]、[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]、[[73-df-dfa-product]]、[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-product","status":"resolved","id":"e1b2071b23104400","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 为同一字母表上的 DFA；令 $n=|Q|,m=|P|$。语言语义、泵引理和乘积见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]、[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]、[[73-df-dfa-product]]、[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-dfa-product-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"33c001ba790a35c7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)$、$N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)$ 为同一字母表上的 DFA；令 $n=|Q|,m=|P|$。语言语义、泵引理和乘积见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]、[[73-thm-finite-automaton-pumping]]、[[73-df-dfa-product]]、[[73-thm-dfa-product-correctness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)","display":false},{"tex":"N=(P,\\Sigma,\\eta,p_0,H)","display":false},{"tex":"n=|Q|,m=|P|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\nL(M)\\ne\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in L(M)\\;|w|<n","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\n|L(M)|\\ge\\aleph_0\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in L(M)\\;(n\\le|w|<2n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}regular\\text{-}decision\\text{-}witness\\text{-}bounds}\\vdash\nL(M)\\ne L(N)\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[|w|<nm\\land\\bigl((w\\in L(M)\\land w\\notin L(N))\\lor(w\\notin L(M)\\land w\\in L(N))\\bigr)\\right]","display":true}],"bytes":2353,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-regular-decision-witness-bounds|正则语言判空、判无限与等价性的有限见证]]"}],"outgoing":["3b7a967565c86f39","e48ecbf40a3c92b6","e1b2